@inherits MvvmComponentBase<마트공개상품상세ViewModel>
@using Ssalddel.Contracts.Common.Mart
@using Ssalddel.Ui.Common.Areas.App.ViewModels

<MudPaper Elevation="0" Outlined="true" Class="mart-product-detail" aria-label="마트 공개 상품 상세">
    @if (ViewModel.처리중)
    {
        <div class="mart-product-detail__state">
            <MudProgressCircular Indeterminate="true" Color="Color.Success" />
            <MudText Typo="Typo.body2">정확한 공개 상품을 불러오고 있습니다.</MudText>
        </div>
    }
    else if (ViewModel.오류발생)
    {
        <div class="mart-product-detail__state">
            <MudIcon Icon="@Icons.Material.Filled.ErrorOutline" Color="Color.Error" Size="Size.Large" />
            <MudText Typo="Typo.subtitle2">상품 상세를 불러오지 못했습니다.</MudText>
            <MudText Typo="Typo.body2">@MartProductPresentation.ErrorMessage(ViewModel.오류메시지)</MudText>
            <MudButton Variant="Variant.Outlined" Color="Color.Success" OnClick="ReloadAsync">다시 시도</MudButton>
        </div>
    }
    else if (ViewModel.찾을수없음)
    {
        <div class="mart-product-detail__state">
            <MudIcon Icon="@Icons.Material.Filled.Inventory2" Size="Size.Large" />
            <MudText Typo="Typo.subtitle2">공개된 마트 상품을 찾을 수 없습니다.</MudText>
            <MudText Typo="Typo.body2">비공개·삭제된 ID를 다른 상품이나 sample 상품으로 대체하지 않습니다.</MudText>
            <MudButton Href="@Context.PathFor(MartProductScreenKind.List)" Variant="Variant.Outlined" Color="Color.Success">상품 목록</MudButton>
        </div>
    }
    else if (ViewModel.상세 is { } detail)
    {
        <div class="mart-product-detail__heading">
            <div>
                <MudText Typo="Typo.overline">EXACT PUBLIC PRODUCT #@detail.Id</MudText>
                <MudText Typo="Typo.h4">@detail.상품명</MudText>
                <MudText Typo="Typo.body2">@MartProductPresentation.ValueOrDash(detail.카테고리) · @MartProductPresentation.ValueOrDash(detail.판매단위)</MudText>
            </div>
            <MudChip T="string" Color="@(detail.판매가능여부 ? Color.Success : Color.Default)" Variant="Variant.Filled">
                @(detail.판매가능여부 ? $"판매 가능 {detail.판매가능수량:N0}" : "품절·판매 준비 중")
            </MudChip>
        </div>

        <div class="mart-product-detail__price">
            <MudText Typo="Typo.h5" Color="Color.Success">@detail.판매가.ToString("N0")원</MudText>
            <MudText Typo="Typo.caption">재고 기준 @MartProductPresentation.ProjectionTime(detail.재고기준시각Utc)</MudText>
        </div>

        <section class="mart-product-detail__description" aria-label="상품 공개 설명">
            <MudText Typo="Typo.subtitle1">상품 공개 설명</MudText>
            <MudText Typo="Typo.body2">@MartProductPresentation.ValueOrDash(detail.설명)</MudText>
            <MudAlert Severity="Severity.Info" Variant="Variant.Text" Dense="true">@detail.재고기준안내</MudAlert>
        </section>

        <section class="mart-product-evidence" aria-label="구매 원장과 구매후기">
            <div class="mart-product-evidence__heading">
                <div>
                    <MudText Typo="Typo.overline">PURCHASE EVIDENCE</MudText>
                    <MudText Typo="Typo.subtitle1">구매 원장과 공개 후기</MudText>
                </div>
                <MudChip T="string"
                         Size="Size.Small"
                         Color="@(detail.구매근거.완료원장확인여부 ? Color.Success : Color.Default)"
                         Variant="Variant.Outlined">
                    @detail.구매근거.원장근거상태
                </MudChip>
            </div>

            <div class="mart-product-evidence__stats">
                <div><span>완료 흐름</span><strong>@(detail.구매근거.완료원장확인여부 ? "확인됨" : "미확인")</strong></div>
                <div><span>공개 후기</span><strong>@($"{detail.구매근거.공개후기수:N0}건")</strong></div>
                <div><span>근거 기준</span><strong>@MartProductPresentation.EvidenceTime(detail.구매근거.근거기준시각Utc)</strong></div>
            </div>

            <MudText Typo="Typo.caption" Color="Color.Secondary">@detail.구매근거.공개범위안내</MudText>

            @if (detail.구매근거.구매후기목록.Count > 0)
            {
                <div class="mart-product-evidence__reviews">
                    @foreach (var review in detail.구매근거.구매후기목록)
                    {
                        <article class="mart-product-review-card">
                            <div class="mart-product-review-card__heading">
                                <div>
                                    <strong>@review.제목</strong>
                                    <span>@review.작성자표시명 · @MartProductPresentation.EvidenceTime(review.작성시각Utc)</span>
                                </div>
                                @if (!string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(CommunityPostBasePath))
                                {
                                    <MudButton Href="@MartProductPresentation.CommunityPostHref(CommunityPostBasePath, review.게시글Id)"
                                               Variant="Variant.Text"
                                               Size="Size.Small"
                                               EndIcon="@Icons.Material.Filled.OpenInNew">
                                        게시글
                                    </MudButton>
                                }
                            </div>
                            <p>@review.본문요약</p>
                            <div class="mart-product-review-card__meta">
                                <span><MudIcon Icon="@Icons.Material.Filled.Recommend" Size="Size.Small" /> @review.추천수.ToString("N0")</span>
                                <span><MudIcon Icon="@Icons.Material.Filled.ChatBubbleOutline" Size="Size.Small" /> @review.댓글수.ToString("N0")</span>
                            </div>
                        </article>
                    }
                </div>
            }
            else
            {
                <div class="mart-product-evidence__empty">
                    <MudIcon Icon="@Icons.Material.Filled.RateReview" />
                    <span>@(detail.구매근거.완료원장확인여부 ? "아직 공개된 구매후기가 없습니다." : "구매 원장이 완료되면 참여자가 후기를 남길 수 있습니다.")</span>
                </div>
            }
        </section>

        <MudAlert Severity="Severity.Warning" Variant="Variant.Outlined" Dense="true">
            이 상세 조회만으로 구매 의향이나 재고 예약을 저장하지 않습니다. 후기와 주문 요청은 별도 화면에서 로그인·서버 검증 뒤 처리합니다.
        </MudAlert>

        <div class="mart-product-detail__actions">
            @if (detail.구매근거.후기작성가능여부)
            {
                <MudButton Href="@Context.PathFor(MartProductScreenKind.Review, detail.Id)"
                           Variant="Variant.Outlined"
                           Color="Color.Success"
                           StartIcon="@Icons.Material.Filled.RateReview">
                    구매후기 작성
                </MudButton>
            }
            @if (detail.구매근거.완료원장확인여부 && !string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(SalesPageComposerPath))
            {
                <MudButton Href="@MartProductPresentation.SalesPageHref(SalesPageComposerPath, detail)"
                           Variant="Variant.Outlined"
                           Color="Color.Primary"
                           StartIcon="@Icons.Material.Filled.Storefront">
                    이 근거로 판매페이지 초안 만들기
                </MudButton>
            }
            <MudButton Href="@Context.PathFor(MartProductScreenKind.Order, detail.Id)"
                       Variant="Variant.Filled"
                       Color="Color.Success"
                       StartIcon="@Icons.Material.Filled.AddShoppingCart"
                       Disabled="@(!detail.판매가능여부)">
                주문 요청 작성
            </MudButton>
        </div>
    }
</MudPaper>

@code {
    [Parameter, EditorRequired] public long ProductId { get; set; }
    [Parameter, EditorRequired] public MartProductNavigationContext Context { get; set; } = new();
    [Parameter] public string? SalesPageComposerPath { get; set; }
    [Parameter] public string? CommunityPostBasePath { get; set; }

    protected override async Task OnParametersSetAsync()
    {
        if (ViewModel.요청ProductId != ProductId)
        {
            await ViewModel.조회Async(ProductId);
        }
    }

    private Task ReloadAsync() => ViewModel.조회Async(ProductId);
}
